Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:13.24,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.99,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:16.82,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:18.68,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:33.17,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}なりたい自分を がむしゃらに追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:38.91,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}気がつけば大人になっていた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.33,0:01:43.97,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人は誰も思い通り 努力すれば夢叶うって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:45.81,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}そんな甘くはないストーリー
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:47.89,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}必死こいて上目指しても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:50.02,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}結果こそ全て 分かってる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:51.15,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}解かってない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:52.90,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}いつかきっと誰か見てる信じ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.19,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今日も歩き続ける
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.99,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}諦めそう挫けそう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:02:00.22,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}から見える景色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:07.77,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}絶望と苦しみの暗闇のその先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:13.13,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}果てなき道の先で待つモノ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:16.88,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}遠くてもこの手で掴み取るため
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:20.47,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}理想とは違う夢のカタチ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.14,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}追い続けもがきながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:24.56,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}前に進むだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.35,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今この手にする
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.10,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}We change the game from our own side
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:31.73,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}まだ見ぬ世界を自由に生きてく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:33.52,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.23,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:37.11,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}Even if they don't match your ideals,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:39.18,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}chase your ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:13.24,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.99,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:16.82,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:18.68,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:33.17,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}不顾一切追寻理想的自我 蓦然回首已褪去年少青涩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:38.91,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}恍然发觉早已成长为大人模样
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.33,0:01:43.97,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}人们总说只要努力付出 就能让美梦成真得偿所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:45.81,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}可现实哪有这般天真浪漫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:47.89,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕拼尽全力向上攀登
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:50.02,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}最终结果才是一切 虽然明白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.05,0:01:51.15,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}却又难以释怀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:52.90,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}坚信终有一天会被人所见证
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:55.19,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}今天也继续迈步向前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.22,0:01:57.99,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在想要放弃想要认输时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:02:00.22,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}看见的风景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:07.77,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}绝望与苦痛交织的黑暗尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:13.13,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在道路终点等待着的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:16.88,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}哪怕遥远也要亲手将其紧握
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:20.47,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}与理想背道而驰的梦想形态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.14,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}继续追寻即使遍体鳞伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:24.56,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要坚定前行不止
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:26.35,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}此刻紧握在手中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.10,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}我们要从己方彻底改写规则
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:31.73,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}在尚未知晓的世界自由生存
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:33.52,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.23,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.26,0:02:37.11,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}即便与理想中的模样大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:39.18,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur3}也要以自己的方式追逐心中所向
